#. column 1: Aether within the body is near completely attuned to the aethertrails left by the dreadwyrm Bahamut. When attunement reaches 6, you will enter the <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Dreadwyrm Trance<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>.
msgctxt "Status:908:0:0"
msgid "Aethertrail Attunement"
msgstr "Созвучие эфирных следов"

